{"parentUuid":"b22ea639-be2d-4c4d-87ec-4b4cc454af18","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CevZSjjHU8f9uwgWyTKTW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"cache_read_input_tokens":83699,"output_tokens":1526,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":493},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1182,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1526,"cache_read_input_tokens":83699,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1182},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CevZSj27yLRN9JxPHfffg","attributionSkill":"memory-write","type":"assistant","uuid":"a6fd69a3-c61e-4316-a567-6fce7c06fdc2","timestamp":"2026-09-10T22:38:02.380Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"5f2ac916-6e52-43f6-bc78-4e7231c4afa0","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA","sessionId":"5f2ac916-6e52-43f6-bc78-4e7231c4afa0","version":"2.1.268","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"a6fd69a3-c61e-4316-a567-6fce7c06fdc2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CevZSjjHU8f9uwgWyTKTW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G9PyMjMavm9DfSiL4TgL1t","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /Users/kristinarash/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_settings-json-bom-trap.md <<'EOF'\n---\nname: settings-json-bom-trap\ndescription: \"A UTF-8 BOM in ~/.claude/settings.json makes dcg report the hook as missing — the fix is stripping the BOM, never `dcg install`\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n---\n\n`~/.claude/settings.json` acquired a **UTF-8 BOM** — the 3 invisible bytes\n`EF BB BF` at the start of the file. Claude Code parses the file anyway, so\nnothing in Claude Code looked broken. `dcg` (Destructive Command Guard) does\nnot, so it printed at every session start:\n\n```\n[dcg] Hook missing from ~/.claude/settings.json — run: dcg install\n```\n\n**The message is wrong, and its suggested fix is the wrong fix.** The hook was\npresent and correct all along, at line 318. Running `dcg install` would have\nadded a second hook to a file the tool cannot read.\n\n**Diagnose, don't trust the banner.** `dcg doctor` names the real fault:\n\n```\nChecking Claude Code settings... OK\nChecking hook wiring... ERROR\n  Invalid JSON: expected value at line 1 column 1\n```\n\n\"Line 1 column 1\" on a file that is visibly valid JSON means a BOM. Confirm it:\n\n```bash\npython3 -c \"import json;json.load(open('/Users/kristinarash/.claude/settings.json'))\"\n# JSONDecodeError: Unexpected UTF-8 BOM (decode using utf-8-sig)\n```\n\n**Fix** — back up, strip 3 bytes, re-run `dcg doctor` (fixed 2026-09-10):\n\n```python\np = \"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/settings.json\"\nb = open(p, \"rb\").read()\nif b.startswith(b\"\\xef\\xbb\\xbf\"):\n    open(p, \"wb\").write(b[3:])\n```\n\n**The generalisation.** A BOM is already a known trap on this machine's data\nfiles (the PFF season CSVs need `encoding='utf-8-sig'`). This is the same trap\non a *config* file, and it is nastier there: the tolerant reader is the one you\nlook at, and the strict reader is the one that complains — about the wrong\nthing. Whenever a tool claims a config entry is missing and you can see the\nentry, check the file's first bytes before editing anything.\n\nRelated: [[dcg-guard-blocks]], [[hook-two-copies-trap]], [[path-shadowing-and-cleanup]]\nEOF\necho \"written\"; wc -c < /Users/kristinarash/.claude/projects/-Users-kristinarash-DEV/memory/project_settings-json-bom-trap.md","description":"Write the new Tier A memory file"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"cache_read_input_tokens":83699,"output_tokens":1526,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":493},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1182,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1526,"cache_read_input_tokens":83699,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1182,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1182},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CevZSj27yLRN9JxPHfffg","attributionSkill":"memory-write","type":"assistant","uuid":"edbc2961-465e-4da0-a46d-22a643e37327","timestamp":"2026-09-10T22:38:13.886Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"5f2ac916-6e52-43f6-bc78-4e7231c4afa0","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PlayCalls_SuccessRate_EPA","sessionId":"5f2ac916-6e52-43f6-bc78-4e7231c4afa0","version":"2.1.268","gitBranch":"main"}
